{{!
    @template mod_qrvote/notopen

    Vote page of a station whose voting window has not started yet.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * name - Activity name, formatted with format_string().
    * question - Question, already formatted with format_text().
    * isstation - Whether the round is a station.
    * title - Station title.
    * location - Station location.
    * window - Formatted voting window.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "name": "Conference feedback",
        "question": "How did you like the talk?",
        "isstation": true,
        "title": "Moodle and AI",
        "location": "Room 104",
        "window": "Saturday, 24 October, 10:00 AM to 11:30 AM"
    }
}}
<div class="mod_qrvote-notopen">
    {{>mod_qrvote/station}}
    <div class="alert alert-info" role="status">{{#str}}error:roundnotopen, mod_qrvote{{/str}}</div>
    <div class="mod_qrvote-question h5 mb-3">{{{question}}}</div>
</div>
